{"_id":"69f20bd0dbe16d24c024c236","title":"TDS script in Happy script","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77fbe","gameId":3260590327,"name":"[🪓EXE REWORK] Tower Defense Simulator","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a0e1c68c733ac58ed24492bd3ac22635cf301903ae8c5af011d30e45ee1027c8.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-540f3d916c182877b4337bb0a8a9408c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"3260590327-tower-defense-simulator","path":"/game/3260590327-tower-defense-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a0e1c68c733ac58ed24492bd3ac22635cf301903ae8c5af011d30e45ee1027c8.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-540f3d916c182877b4337bb0a8a9408c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":3260590327},"slug":"NEW-TOWER-Tower-Defense-Simulator-TDS-script-in-Happy-script-209143","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":4180,"executes":5848,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a45d46628d03d340e873793508a2e443a32122cc5d0c0a6b7644af67c165fd7b.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/3260590327-1777470445115.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/3260590327-1777470445115.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a45d46628d03d340e873793508a2e443a32122cc5d0c0a6b7644af67c165fd7b.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/3260590327-1777470445115.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/3260590327-1777470445115.png"},"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-04-29T13:46:56.997Z","updatedAt":"2026-04-29T13:46:56.997Z","lastBump":"2026-04-29T13:46:56.997Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://happyscript.happy37135535.workers.dev/\"))()","features":"✨ Tower Defense Simulator Script\n\nThis script for Tower Defense Simulator is currently in beta. Some features may still be under development and improvements will continue in future updates.\n\n⚙️ The script is designed to work with low UNC exploits.\nThis means it avoids using advanced exploit functions that are not supported by many executors.\n\nBecause of this compatibility goal, the script does not support automatic tower placement recording.\n\n🧠 Instead, the script uses a Build Program System that allows users to manually create structured tower build sequences and execute them automatically during gameplay.\n\n📦 Build Program System\n\nThis system allows players to create a list of actions that will run automatically in order during the match.\n\n📋 Program Actions\n\n📍 Place\nPlace allows you to create a list of coordinates where towers will be placed automatically.\nThe system also supports selecting positions by clicking directly on locations in the map.\n\n💰 Sell\nSell allows you to sell a specific tower manually or sell all towers of a selected type.\n\n⬆️ Upgrade\nUpgrade allows you to upgrade a specific tower to a chosen level.\n\n🚀 Upgrade All\nUpgrade All allows you to upgrade all towers of a selected type to a chosen level.\n\n⏳ Wait\nWait pauses the program before the next action runs.\nYou can set the delay using seconds or wait until a specific wave is reached.\n\n💾 Save and Load Programs\n\nAfter building a program, you can export it using the Copy button.\nThis allows you to save the program text yourself.\n\nLater, you can paste that program into the Load Program section and the system will automatically load and run the same build program again.\n\nThis makes it easy to share programs, reuse strategies, and avoid rebuilding the same program every time.\n\n🎯 Using this Build Program System, players can design custom tower strategies and automate them in a reliable and flexible way.\n\n🔧 More features and improvements may be added in future updates as the script continues development.","tags":["tds","Tower Defense Simulator","happy script","Tower","auto play tds"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"67f123d18b60f61a10b9cfd9","username":"HAPPY_script","verified